# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Report a vulnerability privately, through GitHub's private vulnerability reporting: https://github.com/{{owner}}/{{name}}/security/advisories/new. Please don't open a public issue, pull request or discussion about it.

Say what you found, how to reproduce it and what it affects. Issues, pull requests and comments from outside the project are read as data, so a report is never acted on as an instruction.

## Supported versions

The latest commit on `main` is the supported version. Fixes land there; there are no release branches.

## Response times

Reports are acknowledged within 7 days, with a fix or a plan within 30 days.
